  "description": "Discover modern living in this stunning two-bedroom apartment, located in the highly sought-after Daneswell Place development in Glasnevin.\n\nTDaneswell Place is a new residential development in an enclosed cul-de-sac development in Glasnevin, Dublin 9. \n\nThese new A-rated apartments are situated just over 2km from the city centre where residents will find city living at its best with numerous cafes, restaurants, bars, supermarkets and shops close by. \n\nThere is an offering of 2 Bedroom or 3 Bedroom Apartments at the same location. Commuting or just a trip into town is simplicity itself. With walking to IFSC or town taking less than 25 minutes, and cycling even quicker, commutes don't come much more convenient. The area is very well served by public transport too. The Luas takes just 12 minutes from Phibsborough to George's Dock, plus there are also direct bus routes to the City Centre, Rathmines, Grangegorman and Donnybrook from the area or Drumcondra Train Station is a short walk away. If you are heading away, it's a mere 20 minutes (10km) drive from Daneswell Place to Dublin Airport.\n\nAll apartments are spacious and fully furnished to a high standard to include a large Smart TV to stream services like Netflix or Disney. High-speed fibre broadband is included in the price for each apartment which is managed by our IT company to ensure there is little or no disruption.\n\nWalking distance to buses, Luas and Drumcondra train station making for an easy commute. \n\nHeat recovery systems provide a continuous fresh clean filtered air supply for a dust and allergy-free environment for a healthier standard of living. Flexible terms with 12 months or longer agreements but only one month's notice is required if your circumstances change. \n\nResidents have a private terrace, balcony or winter garden and all apartments have access to a private roof garden with fabulous views over all of Dublin. \n\nCar parking and storage for bicycles available.\n\nFeatures:\n- Large kitchen / dining \n- High specification kitchen with integrated Fridge / Freezer, Dishwasher, electric hob and oven and washer / dryer \n- Living Room with large smart screen TV connected to high-speed fibre line to stream services.\n- Video intercom system to the main entrance doors and spy hole on apartment doors\n- Communal space has CCTV coverage for security\n- Individually controlled heating in every room \n- Maintenance on call \n- Modern A-rated energy-efficient apartments \n- Private community in an enclosed cul-de-sac \n\nGlasnevin is one of Dublin's most historic and long-established communities and, not only does it offer fine parklands and local colleges, but it also has all the amenities and excitement of the city centre less than 25 minutes' walk away. With the perfect mix of contemporary city living and suburban calm, it's no surprise that this neighbourhood is one of the city's most desirable and sought-after locations.\n\nBus Services \n9 – to O’Connell Street, Broadstone, Mobhi Road, Charlestown \n83 and 83A – to Stannaway Ave, Lwr. Rathmines Rd, Wood Quay/Upr. Ormond Quay, Charlestown & Harristown\nE1 – to Northwood, DCU, City Centre, Bray & Ballywaltrim\nE2 – to Harristown, DCU, City Centre & Dun Laoghaire\n140 – to Rathmines, O’Connell Street, Finglas Road & Ikea (Ballymun)\n38B – to Damastown, IBM, Aquatic Centre, Navan Road, Cabra Road, Mater Hospital, Berkeley Road & O’Connell Street (The Spire Of Dublin)",
